1373-        """Run a healthcheck, defaulting to the environment-level config.
1374-
1375-        Mirrors Docker HEALTHCHECK semantics: during the start period,
1376-        failures don't count toward retries. After the start period,
1377-        consecutive failures are counted and the check fails after
1378-        exceeding the retry limit.
1379-
1380-        Args:
1381-            healthcheck: Optional override. When ``None``, falls back to
1382-                ``task_env_config.healthcheck`` (the top-level healthcheck).
1383-                Callers pass a per-step config here to run a step-scoped
1384-                healthcheck.
1385-        """
